 this portfolio will streamline the clinical development and commercialization process for new drugs and increase the adoption rates of new biomarker-driven therapies post-approval.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/15/guardant-health-gh-q4-2018-earnings-conference-cal.aspx"},{"c":"GH 2020 Q3","e":"gh","d":"2020-11-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Helmy Eltoukhy","x":"…committed to, and we believe that really making sure that we engage all channels, not just personal promotion, but digital promotion, direct-to-consumer, as well as partnering with other stakeholders is -- those are all on the table and are all going to be components of our commercial framework.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/07/guardant-health-inc-gh-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"GH 2021 Q2","e":"gh","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"AmirAli Talasaz","x":"To that end, we have recently partnered with Lunit, a company focused on AI powered radiology and pathology solution, with the vision of streamlining this screening journey for patients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/guardant-health-inc-gh-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"GH 2021 Q2","e":"gh","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Helmy Eltoukhy","x":"And when you think about what would be the future of screening, we believe this has-the blood-based assay are very important, but cannot be the only assets there to really streamline screening journey for the patients.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/guardant-health-inc-gh-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"GH 2021 Q2","e":"gh","d":"2021-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Bell","x":"Therefore we are maintaining our guidance of $360 million to $370 million representing growth of approximately 27% of the 2020 of the midpoint of the range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/guardant-health-inc-gh-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"GH 2021 Q2","e":"gh","d":"2021-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Bell","x":"So again, just another reason why we've maintained the guidance where it is.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/guardant-health-inc-gh-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"GH 2025 Q3","e":"gh","d":"2025-10-29","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Anthony Massaro","x":"Or do you think there is obviously upside from partnerships with Quest, PathGroup, you know, certainly guideline inclusion and potential DTC uplift?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/guardant-health-gh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GH 2025 Q3","e":"gh","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Bell","x":"This submission has the potential to streamline Guardant360 Liquid with a single flagship FDA-approved liquid biopsy for therapy selection, simplifying our portfolio, accelerating adoption, and further strengthening our leadership in this space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/guardant-health-gh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GH 2025 Q3","e":"gh","d":"2025-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"AmirAli Talasaz","x":"So as you have seen, we consistently raised our outlook throughout this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/guardant-health-gh-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GH 2026 Q1","e":"gh","d":"2026-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"AmirAli Talasaz","x":"Taking a closer look at our direct-to-consumer programs on Slide 14.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/guardant-health-gh-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"GH 2026 Q1","e":"gh","d":"2026-05-07","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"AmirAli Talasaz","x":"We launched our DTC and influencer campaigns in conjunction with colorectal cancer awareness month, including our national campaign with Pat